    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 16, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "第二天中午，<br>\n我独自一人前往招待所。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 18, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "趁着早晨的放风时间，我去了仓库，<br>\n将冰镐、御寒用品<br>\n以及应急食品塞进包里，做好了万全的准备。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（这次一定要查明真相！）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "怀揣着坚定的决心，<br>\n正准备出发时。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_173", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——希罗！", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Leia001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "听见背后传来声音，我回头一看，<br>\n蕾雅、雪莉、汉娜，还有米莉亚<br>\n正朝着我跑来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她们每个人都和我一样带着包。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你们怎么来了……有什么事？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Miria"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hanna"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "从早餐的时候开始，大家就在讨论说，<br>\n希罗看起来状态有点不对。", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hanna001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看上去像是一个人<br>\n背负了什么重任……", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Miria001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "请不要独自烦恼！<br>\n我们可是同伴啊！", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Sherry001"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗一连好几天都在调查地下，<br>\n这件事我们大家都知道。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Leia002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "今天你也要去调查地下吧？<br>\n我们也一起——", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Leia003"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_18", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.1"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 69, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 71, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "蕾雅向我靠近并伸出手，<br>\n我却不由自主地挥开了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 73, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "出于尴尬，<br>\n我不敢正视蕾雅的脸。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 75, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不要靠近我。我自己一个人解决。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗，你到底是——", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Leia004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你们都是累赘！<br>\n一发生凶杀案就把我当成凶手，<br>\n从一开始到现在都只会妨碍我……！", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "别再靠近我了！<br>\n你们这些……肮脏的、魔女……！", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "为了让她们远离自己，<br>\n我故意选择了最恶毒的话语。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然而，这些恶毒的话<br>\n也深深刺痛着自己。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "SpawnShake", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorId": "Camera", "ShakeCount": 2, "ShakeAmplitude": 0.10000000149011612, "AmplitudeVariation": 0.15000000596046448}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 96, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "话音未落，我便支撑不住，单膝跪地。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "呼吸开始急促。<br>\n思绪混乱，感觉自己的心正逐渐被黑暗吞没。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 100, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 102, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗，<br>\n难道你正在加剧魔女化……？", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Sherry002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 104, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "听到这突如其来的低语，<br>\n我的身体猛然僵硬。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 106, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hanna.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你、你不会对谁<br>\n产生了杀意吧……！？", "AuthorId": "Hanna", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hanna002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我不是魔女！<br>\n别拿我跟你们相提并论！！", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 116, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hanna"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [40.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 118, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hanna"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 120, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.4"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 122, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我抬头怒视，大声喊道。<br>\n汉娜连忙躲到了雪莉身后。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 124, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 126, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我努力调整紊乱的呼吸，<br>\n再次迈步朝招待所走去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我的理智还在。<br>\n　我没问题，一定还来得及。）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 130, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗不会杀我们的。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Leia005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 135, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "即使我那样冷酷拒绝，<br>\n蕾雅依然跟了上来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 137, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Miria.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 139, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "比起独自探索，<br>\n大家合作一定效率更高……<br>\n你觉得呢？", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Miria002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 141, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 143, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hanna.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 145, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "米莉亚、雪莉、汉娜也跟上来了。<br>\n接着……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 147, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 151, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_173", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗——！大家——！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "StopSfx", "line": 157, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我、我也来帮忙……！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "连艾玛都来了。<br>\n我深深叹了口气。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative017"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 168, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.0], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Smile1,ArmR3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "烧已经退了，头脑也清醒了，<br>\n我已经病好了。大家一起去调查地下吧！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 172, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 174, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……随你们便。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 176, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "说实话，我害怕有人在身边时，<br>\n自己会失去自我，彻底失控。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 178, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "昨天说出冷酷的话的亚里沙，恐怕也是这么想的。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 180, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（我不想伤害任何人。<br>\n　不想杀死任何人……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Hiro009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 182, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙没有出现在这里，<br>\n想必是害怕自己会将无差别的杀意投向某个人，<br>\n才刻意回避接近大家的。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 184, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但她们似乎<br>\n根本无法察觉我内心的纠葛。<br>", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative021"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 186, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我明白，再继续拒绝也无济于事，<br>\n只能决定接受她们的协助。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv11_Narrative022"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 188, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 190, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act02_Chapter04/Act02_Chapter04_Adv12", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0204Adv11_Narrative001": "第二天中午，<br>\n我独自一人前往招待所。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative002": "趁着早晨的放风时间，我去了仓库，<br>\n将冰镐、御寒用品<br>\n以及应急食品塞进包里，做好了万全的准备。",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro001": "（这次一定要查明真相！）",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative003": "怀揣着坚定的决心，<br>\n正准备出发时。",
  "0204Adv11_Leia001": "——希罗！",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative004": "听见背后传来声音，我回头一看，<br>\n蕾雅、雪莉、汉娜，还有米莉亚<br>\n正朝着我跑来。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative005": "她们每个人都和我一样带着包。",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro002": "你们怎么来了……有什么事？",
  "0204Adv11_Hanna001": "从早餐的时候开始，大家就在讨论说，<br>\n希罗看起来状态有点不对。",
  "0204Adv11_Miria001": "看上去像是一个人<br>\n背负了什么重任……",
  "0204Adv11_Sherry001": "请不要独自烦恼！<br>\n我们可是同伴啊！",
  "0204Adv11_Leia002": "希罗一连好几天都在调查地下，<br>\n这件事我们大家都知道。",
  "0204Adv11_Leia003": "今天你也要去调查地下吧？<br>\n我们也一起——",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative006": "蕾雅向我靠近并伸出手，<br>\n我却不由自主地挥开了。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative007": "出于尴尬，<br>\n我不敢正视蕾雅的脸。",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro003": "不要靠近我。我自己一个人解决。",
  "0204Adv11_Leia004": "希罗，你到底是——",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro004": "你们都是累赘！<br>\n一发生凶杀案就把我当成凶手，<br>\n从一开始到现在都只会妨碍我……！",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro005": "别再靠近我了！<br>\n你们这些……肮脏的、魔女……！",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative008": "为了让她们远离自己，<br>\n我故意选择了最恶毒的话语。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative009": "然而，这些恶毒的话<br>\n也深深刺痛着自己。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative010": "话音未落，我便支撑不住，单膝跪地。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative011": "呼吸开始急促。<br>\n思绪混乱，感觉自己的心正逐渐被黑暗吞没。",
  "0204Adv11_Sherry002": "希罗，<br>\n难道你正在加剧魔女化……？",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative012": "听到这突如其来的低语，<br>\n我的身体猛然僵硬。",
  "0204Adv11_Hanna002": "你、你不会对谁<br>\n产生了杀意吧……！？",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro006": "我不是魔女！<br>\n别拿我跟你们相提并论！！",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative013": "我抬头怒视，大声喊道。<br>\n汉娜连忙躲到了雪莉身后。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative014": "我努力调整紊乱的呼吸，<br>\n再次迈步朝招待所走去。",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro007": "（我的理智还在。<br>\n　我没问题，一定还来得及。）",
  "0204Adv11_Leia005": "希罗不会杀我们的。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative015": "即使我那样冷酷拒绝，<br>\n蕾雅依然跟了上来。",
  "0204Adv11_Miria002": "比起独自探索，<br>\n大家合作一定效率更高……<br>\n你觉得呢？",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative016": "米莉亚、雪莉、汉娜也跟上来了。<br>\n接着……",
  "0204Adv11_Ema001": "希罗——！大家——！",
  "0204Adv11_Ema002": "我、我也来帮忙……！",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative017": "连艾玛都来了。<br>\n我深深叹了口气。",
  "0204Adv11_Ema003": "烧已经退了，头脑也清醒了，<br>\n我已经病好了。大家一起去调查地下吧！",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro008": "……随你们便。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative018": "说实话，我害怕有人在身边时，<br>\n自己会失去自我，彻底失控。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative019": "昨天说出冷酷的话的亚里沙，恐怕也是这么想的。",
  "0204Adv11_Hiro009": "（我不想伤害任何人。<br>\n　不想杀死任何人……）",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative020": "亚里沙没有出现在这里，<br>\n想必是害怕自己会将无差别的杀意投向某个人，<br>\n才刻意回避接近大家的。",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative021": "但她们似乎<br>\n根本无法察觉我内心的纠葛。<br>",
  "0204Adv11_Narrative022": "我明白，再继续拒绝也无济于事，<br>\n只能决定接受她们的协助。"
}
}
